## Technical
Architecture, code layout, interface conventions, data-store design — **only what's decided.**
Leave undecided things marked "TBD, ask before assuming."

## Tests / commands
How to run tests, where golden cases live (`tests/golden/`, upgrade Phase 3), what "passing" means,
and the regression scope.

## Risk boundaries
**See `RISK_TIERS.md`** — the single source of truth for which paths Claude may edit directly, which
need confirmation, and which are off-limits. Do not restate the tiers here; just note anything
